%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhahahaha, yeah. But you're lying about not noticing that\nsooner, aren't you?\d%K%P
「啊哈哈哈，算是吧。\n但你说没注意到是骗我的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen, how about something more interesting like... Mr.\nHomewrecker, or Mr. Misunderstanding?\d%K%P
