%LC理
\dEh? Ah...\d%K%P
「诶？啊…」%K%P
Mitoko reached out towards my neck, her forehead\nglistening with sweat.%K%P
美都子不顾额头上渗出的汗水，\n慢慢把手伸向我的脖子。%K%P
