「重新系一下…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko...\d%K%P
「美、美都子…」%K%P
Oh, she was actually reaching towards the reddish violet\nnecktie dangling below my neck.%K%P
准确地说，是伸向我那耷拉着的\n深红色领带。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNgh... Huff... Just look at how crooked it is.\d%K%P
