Well, I wasn't particularly good with my hands.%K%P
嘛，要说的话，\n我也不是手巧的人。%K%P
When I looked in the mirror, I did notice my necktie being\nsomewhat asymmetrical, but I just gave up with a meek\nsmile. As always.%K%P
刚才看着镜子里那副左右不对称的苦笑模样，\n我也只能对自己不会打领带这一残酷事实深感无奈。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm...\d%K%P
「嗯～…」%K%P
