Which restaurant would she prefer...? Shanzeriya or\nShakers?%K%P
哪好呢…？\n『香泽里拉』还是『夏克兹』… %K%P
No, maybe I should take her somewhere better, like Italian\nCelery... Could I even afford a place like that with my\ncurrent salary...?%K%P
不，还是去稍微豪华点的，『意大利·西芹馆』…\n『壁之灰泥』和『Cannavaro』的话，凭我现在的收入…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhoa?!\d%K%P
「诶！？」%K%P
