The clock on the office wall claimed it was 8PM.%K%P
时钟的时针指向了８点。%K%P
The average employee would likely still be working\novertime at this hour.%K%P
如果是普通公司职员的话，这个时间\n就算拼命加班也没什么好奇怪的。%K%P
But for a complete newbie hired in the middle of the\nseason, and on his first day to boot... Well, let's just\nsay I felt as though I'd had my life energy squeezed out\nof me, down to the last drop.%K%P
不过作为第一天上班而且是半路出家的新员工，\n今天这不管怎么想都是在剥削压榨我吧。%K%P
